:" of program derived addresses and bump seeds."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" [`find_program_address`]: Pubkey::find_program_address"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" # Examples"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" Creating a program derived address involves iteratively searching for a"},{"DocComment":" bump seed for which the derived [`Pubkey`] does not lie on the ed25519"},{"DocComment":" curve. This search process is generally performed off-chain, with the"},{"DocComment":" [`find_program_address`] function, after which the client passes the"},{"DocComment":" bump seed to the program as instruction data."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" Depending on the application requirements, a program may wish to verify"},{"DocComment":" that the set of seeds, plus the bump seed, do correctly generate an"},{"DocComment":" expected address."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" The verification is performed by appending to the other seeds one"},{"DocComment":" additional seed slice that contains the single `u8` bump seed, calling"},{"DocComment":" `create_program_address`, checking that the return value is `Ok`, and"},{"DocComment":" that the returned `Pubkey` has the expected value."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" ```"},{"DocComment":" # use solana_pubkey::Pubkey;"},{"DocComment":" # let program_id = Pubkey::new_unique();"},{"DocComment":" let (expected_pda, bump_seed) = Pubkey::find_program_address(&[b\"vault\"], &program_id);"},{"DocComment":" let actual_pda = Pubkey::create_program_address(&[b\"vault\", &[bump_seed]], &program_id)?;"},{"DocComment":" assert_eq!(expected_pda, actual_pda);"},{"DocComment":" # Ok::<(), anyhow::Error>(())"},{"DocComment":" ```"}],"inline":null,"rename":null,"public":true},"is_local":false,"opacity":"Foreign","lang_item":null},"generics":{"regions":[{"index":0,"name":null,"mutability":"Unknown"},{"index":1,"name":null,"mutability":"Unknown"},{"index":2,"name":null,"mutability":"Unknown"}],"types":[],"const_generics":[],"trait_clause